OL,3,AToo early to say what motive for
OL,4,ADubai-Tel Aviv flight attack was,
OL,5,AIsraeli PM says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe stabbed pilot, named as Indian
OL,8,Fnational Captain Smit Machchhar, was
OL,9,Ftaken to hospital but is in a stable
OL,10,Fcondition. He has been hailed as a
OL,11,F"true hero" by Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,12,FNetanyahu.
OL,14,FAfter landing, passengers described the
OL,15,Fmoment they broke into the cockpit, the
OL,16,Fsound of screams and seeing blood.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
